  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "The coefficient of $x^8$ in $(1-3x)^6(1+9x^2)^6(1+3x)^6$ is",
  "options": {
    "A": "$-3^9\\times5$",
    "B": "$3^9\\times5$",
    "C": "$-3^8\\times5$",
    "D": "$3^8\\times5$"
  },
  "answer": "B",
  "solution": "$(1-3x)^6(1+9x^2)^6(1+3x)^6=(1-9x^2)^6(1+9x^2)^6=(1-81x^4)^6$.\n\nThe $x^8$ coefficient is $\\binom{6}{2}(-81)^2=5\\times3^9$.",
